sequenceDiagram
    participant Put as Put path
    participant Q as pendingFlush
    participant F as flusher
    participant SST as sst file
    participant M as manifest
    participant MEM as sstables slice
    participant WS as wal.flush
    participant W as wal.log

    Put->>Q: freeze active memtable + walCutoff
    Put->>F: signal flushCh
    F->>Q: pop head entry
    F->>SST: write sorted entries (.tmp → rename)
    F->>M: AppendNewFile + fsync
    Note over M: durability boundary for flush
    F->>MEM: append Reader
    F->>WS: write FreezeOffset + SSTID + fsync
    F->>W: TruncateBefore(FreezeOffset)
    F->>WS: remove wal.flush
    F->>F: maybeTriggerCompaction
